{"articleNo":"2228","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2228&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"유엔 국제회의 참가자 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.01.10","hit":"8694","attachments":[{"name":"공고문1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2228&attachNo=71423"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">청소년의 국제회의 경험을 쌓고 글로벌역량을 강화하고자 유엔에서 개최하는 국제회의에 참가할 청소년 대표를 아래와 같이 모집하니,<br>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">관심있는&nbsp;본교생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 6pt\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">가. 회의 개요</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 회의명 : 제50차 유엔 사회개발위원회<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 회의주제, 기간 및 장소, 파견인원<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"23\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"164\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">회의(발언)주제</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"23\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"153\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">파견기간</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"23\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"112\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">회의장소</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"23\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"89\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">파견인원</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"164\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 19pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">빈곤퇴치 또는 청년 실업 해소</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"153\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012.2.1~2.10 중 3~5일 파견</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"112\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">미국, 뉴욕 유엔본부</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"89\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1명</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 파견기간은 현지일정과 항공일정 등에 따라 다소 변경될 수 있음<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3) 제50차 유엔 사회개발위원회는 외교통상부(인권사회과)에서는 유엔과 협의되어 진행되는 유엔 공식회의<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4) 여성가족부에서 왕복 항공료의 70% 지원</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">나. 참가 자격<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1) 만18세(1994년생)～24세(1988년생) 대한민국 청소년으로 빈곤퇴치 또는 청년 실업 해소 문제에 관심이 많은 청소년<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2) 영어로 토론 및 발표가 가능한 자<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3) 해외여행에 결격사유가 없는 자<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4) 최근 3년(‘09년 이후 현재까지)내 여성가족부(구. 보건복지가족부 포함) 시행 모든 청소년 국제교류 프로그램 기참자가 선발 제외</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">다. 신청 기한</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 2012. 1. 12(목) 24:00 까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">라. 신청 방법</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 청소년국제교류네트워크(www.iye.go.kr) 회원가입 후 신청</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">자세한 사항은 붙임 공고문 참조</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임 &nbsp;유엔 국제회의 참가 청소년 모집 공고 공고문 1부. &nbsp;끝.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
